## 🚀 How to Run

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/python-hangman-game.git
```

### 2. Open the project folder

```bash
cd python-hangman-game
```

### 3. Run the game

```bash
python hangman.py
```

## 🎮 How to Play

1. Start the game.
2. A hidden word will be selected randomly.
3. Guess one letter at a time.
4. Correct guesses reveal the letters in the word.
5. Incorrect guesses reduce your remaining attempts.
6. Guess the complete word before all 6 attempts are used to win.

## 💻 Example

```text
Welcome to Hangman!

Word: _ _ _ _ _

Guess a letter: p

Good guess!

Word: p _ _ _ _

Guess a letter: y

Good guess!

Word: p y _ _ _

...

Congratulations! You guessed the word!
```

